  <content>
  <section><table class="os-raise-horizontaltable">
  <thead/>
<tbody>
  <row>
    <entry scope="row" class="emphasis">Number of guests, \( g \)</entry>
    <entry>1 </entry>
    <entry>2 </entry>
    <entry>3 </entry>
    <entry>12 </entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry scope="row" class="emphasis">Number of cupcakes per guest, \( n \)</entry>
    <entry>24 </entry>
    <entry>12 </entry>
    <entry>8 </entry>
    <entry>2 </entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</table>

<para>What is one way to write the relationship between the number of guests and the number of cupcakes per guest from the table above?</para>

</section>
